---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CC3PO Agency — Websites, Domains & Automation">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Your Website,<br><span class="text-emerald-400">Your Way</span></h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        One place to buy your domain, build your site, and manage everything.
        No tech skills needed. No multiple vendors. No hidden fees.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="#pricing" class="bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition text-lg">See Plans</a>
        <a href="#domain" class="border border-gray-600 hover:border-emerald-500 text-white font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition text-lg">Buy a Domain</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Flow -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-10">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Buy Your Domain</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Search and register your domain through our link. Or bring your own.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Choose Your Path</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">We build it for you, or use Bolt.new to build it yourself with AI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Get Your Portal</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">White-label dashboard to manage your site, email, and billing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">4</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Go Live</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Site deployed on SiteGround with SSL, CDN, backups, and monitoring.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Domain Search Section -->
    <div id="domain" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Step 1: Get Your Domain</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Search for available domains. We use SiteGround for registration — you get a great price, we get a small commission.</p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-6">
        <input type="text" placeholder="yourbusiness.com" class="flex-1 bg-[#1a1a2e] border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500" />
        <a href="https://www.siteground.com/go/a3sob40itj" target="_blank" class="bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition whitespace-nowrap text-center">Search on SiteGround →</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 space-y-2">
        <p>💡 <strong>Domains start at ~$10-15/year</strong> for .com through SiteGround. No markup, no hidden fees.</p>
        <p>🔗 <strong>Already have a domain?</strong> Great — we can use your existing domain. Just pick a plan below and we'll point it to your new site.</p>
        <p>🏷️ <strong>Buy through our link</strong> and we earn a small commission that helps keep our service prices low. <a href="https://www.siteground.com/go/a3sob40itj" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300" target="_blank">Search domains here →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: Choose Your Path -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-2">Step 2: Choose Your Path</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-center mb-10">Two ways to get your site built. Pick the one that fits you.</p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Path A: We Build -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border-2 border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">🛠️ We Build It For You</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Tell us what you need. We use AI to build your site fast. You review, we refine, you go live.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 text-gray-400 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Built in 24-48 hours</li>
            <li>✓ You review and request changes</li>
            <li>✓ We handle domain setup, SSL, everything</li>
            <li>✓ Ongoing support and edits</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#pricing" class="block text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition">See Plans →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Path B: You Build with Bolt.new -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">🤖 Build It Yourself with Bolt.new</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Use Bolt.new — the AI-powered web builder — to create your own site. We host it on SiteGround.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 text-gray-400 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Describe your site in plain English</li>
            <li>✓ Bolt.new builds it with AI in minutes</li>
            <li>✓ Export and deploy to your SiteGround hosting</li>
            <li>✓ We handle the technical setup</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://bolt.new" target="_blank" class="block text-center border border-gray-600 hover:border-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition">Try Bolt.new →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Tiers -->
    <div id="pricing" class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-2">Step 3: Pick a Plan</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-center mb-10">All plans include hosting, SSL, CDN, backups, and your own white-label portal.</p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Spark -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Spark</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">Perfect for getting started</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-1">$97<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-6">Domain not included (~$10-15/yr)</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ 1-page professional website</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Free SSL & CDN</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Daily backups</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Email account setup</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ 1 monthly edit</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ White-label client portal</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/9B600i1ZI3EXelS5C41B61z" class="block text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition">Get Spark</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Engine -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border-2 border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col relative">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0">
            <span class="block bg-emerald-500 text-black text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-bl-lg">POPULAR</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Engine</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">For growing businesses</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-1">$297<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-6">Domain not included (~$10-15/yr)</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Multi-page website (up to 5 pages)</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Blog setup</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ SEO optimization</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Free SSL & CDN</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Daily backups</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ 3 monthly edits</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Domain setup + migration</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ White-label client portal</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/00w14mgUC1wPa5Ce8A1B61A" class="block text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition">Get Engine</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Command -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Command</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">Full power for serious businesses</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-1">$497<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-6">Domain not included (~$10-15/yr)</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-8 flex-1">
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Full custom website (unlimited pages)</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Ecommerce ready</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Advanced SEO + analytics</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Free SSL & CDN</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Daily backups</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Priority support</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ Unlimited edits</li>
            <li class="text-gray-400 text-sm">✓ White-label client portal</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/28E9AS9sa0sLgu08Og1B61B" class="block text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold py-3 rounded-lg transition">Get Command</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why Bolt.new -->
    <div class="mb-16 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Powered by Bolt.new</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Every site we build is powered by <a href="https://bolt.new" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300" target="_blank">Bolt.new</a> — the AI-powered web builder by StackBlitz. Here's why that matters:</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">⚡ Built in Hours, Not Weeks</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Traditional agencies take 4-6 weeks. Bolt.new lets us build in 24-48 hours. You get your site faster.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">🔄 Easy Updates</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Need a change? Just tell us. We update your site and deploy instantly. No complex CMS training needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">🔧 Full Customization</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Unlike drag-and-drop builders, Bolt.new generates real code. Your site isn't locked into a template — it grows with you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-800">
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
          💡 <strong>Want to build your own sites?</strong> Sign up for Bolt.new and get 200K free tokens to start. 
          <a href="https://bolt.new" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300" target="_blank">Try Bolt.new →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Add-on Services -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-2">Add-On Services</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-center mb-10">Already have a site? Add these automated services to any plan.</p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/products/shield/" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition group">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">Compliance Shield</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">ADA/WCAG monitoring + auto-fixes. $97/mo</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/voice-agent/" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition group">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">AI Voice Agent</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">24/7 AI phone answering for your business. $97/mo</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/resena/" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition group">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">Reseña</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Automated review generation + reputation management. $97/mo</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/site-health/" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition group">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">SiteHealth</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Uptime + Core Web Vitals monitoring. $49/mo</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/disclose-shield/" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition group">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">DiscloseShield</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">AI Act chatbot disclosure compliance. $67/mo</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/products/scan/" class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition group">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition">Free Business Scan</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Free compliance + performance scan. No credit card.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Can I use my own domain?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Yes! If you already own a domain, we'll point it to your new site. No extra cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">How much does a domain cost?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Domains are ~$10-15/year for .com through <a href="https://www.siteground.com/go/a3sob40itj" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300" target="_blank">SiteGround</a>. We handle the registration for you, or you can buy it yourself through our affiliate link.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">What if I want to buy my own domain?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Use our <a href="https://www.siteground.com/go/a3sob40itj" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300" target="_blank">dedicated affiliate link</a> to register your domain or hosting. We earn a commission that helps keep our service prices low. Then send us the domain name and we'll set everything up.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Can I build my own site with Bolt.new?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Absolutely. Sign up at <a href="https://bolt.new" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300" target="_blank">bolt.new</a>, build your site with AI, then we'll deploy it on your SiteGround hosting. We handle the technical setup — you focus on the design.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">What's a white-label portal?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">When you sign up, you get access to your own dashboard where you can manage your site, email accounts, and billing. It's branded as "CC3PO" — no SiteGround or third-party branding. You log in at your own URL.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Can I transfer my existing site?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Yes. We migrate your existing site to our hosting for free. Just pick a plan and we handle the rest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
